-[7]: #worker-in-waiting
-[8]: #activation-process
-[9]: #service-worker-global-scope-interface
-[10]: #active-worker
-[11]: #functional-events
-[12]: #document-control
-[13]: http://www.whatwg.org/specs/web-apps/current-work/multipage/history.html#navigate
-[14]: #registration
-
--->
